From 5ba4f97728b7bee40f088cb6acc3e5c4b5bf7750 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:19:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: move onto the page structure (DumpPage +
 DumpPageContext)

DumpScreen becomes the DumpPage container, which owns the feed (useDumpFeed)
and provides capture, captureError and loadMore through the new
DumpPageContext: DumpComposer takes no props and DumpFeed drops its
onLoadMore callback. The route's {data} unwrapping and header week move into
the pure adapter toDumpPageProps(feed, totalCount, today) in utils/dump.ts,
with unit tests; the Dump scenarios feed raw action-shaped fixtures through
the same adapter. The page's prop types live in types/dump.ts, shared with
useDumpFeed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KCt6pLLUiRAHZu45QycSRC
